  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "Shared runtime",
      "items": [
        "dmserver and embedded bench scenarios share server/internal/runtime. Remote listeners require TLS; plain HTTP is limited to literal loopback. Private DDM forwarding requires HTTPS.",
        "The application registers workers for supervision and readiness. A worker failure cancels sibling loops and reaches the runtime supervisor; a shutdown signal follows the ordered HTTP drain path."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "Configured services and workers",
      "items": [
        "Managed setup registers certificate-renewal and device-identity-renewal workers. SQL applications register persistent event-delivery; DDM, retention and Apple inventory workers follow configured capabilities.",
        "mdm and all expose configured enrollment and /mdm. ddm serves the internal adapter. Enrollment discovery, trust routes and app-push clients are conditional capabilities."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "neutral",
      "title": "Ordered shutdown",
      "items": [
        "On normal shutdown, stop accepting HTTP requests and drain them before stopping and awaiting workers. Then close clients, stores and application resources.",
        "A worker failure may already have cancelled its siblings when HTTP draining begins. Shutdown is bounded, preserves the first failure and retains pending SQL deliveries."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "warning",
      "title": "Maintenance is a resumable pause",
      "items": [
        "Shared SQL maintenance state gates request admission. A pause closes admission, cancels workers and waits for admitted HTTP requests and all worker writes before the participant acknowledges.",
        "New requests receive 503 during the pause or a control-store failure. The fence persists across timeout and restart; only the matching ownership ticket resumes work. Every registered writer must acknowledge."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Implementation references",
      "items": [
        "Runtime supervision — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/7500eb25e50a2913338339d5fced18dc7f41fdc3/server/internal/runtime/runtime.go",
        "Worker registration — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/7500eb25e50a2913338339d5fced18dc7f41fdc3/server/internal/app/app.go",
        "Maintenance participant — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/7500eb25e50a2913338339d5fced18dc7f41fdc3/server/maintenance/participant.go"
      ]
    }
